{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John, long time no see! Hope you've been doing well. Since we last chat, some stuff's happened. Last week, I had a huge writing issue - got stuck on a plot twist and couldn't find my way out. It was crazy frustrating, but I kept pushing and eventually got the ideas flowing again."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-8caaae00521cebac9649332a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.765555+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8caaae00521cebac9649332a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8caaae00521cebac9649332a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Tim! Awesome to hear from you. Yeah, I get how that would've been so annoying! But you stuck it out, that's so cool. Same with me on the court. Just gotta find a way to tough it out and keep things flowing. Then when you make it through, it's all the more satisfying, right?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-265e0001b07c73625d98c575", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.796060+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "265e0001b07c73625d98c575", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "265e0001b07c73625d98c575", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Yeah! It was hard but once it's over, the feeling is amazing. That's what makes it so beautiful, the struggle and then the satisfaction."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-0dd0668b9f607e7131e3a031", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.814783+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0dd0668b9f607e7131e3a031", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0dd0668b9f607e7131e3a031", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah! Struggles make it worth it. Like in sports, that's when the win feels great! Challenges force us to develop and become better."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-50ab07a3238ffa5bbcaae7d2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.834783+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "50ab07a3238ffa5bbcaae7d2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "50ab07a3238ffa5bbcaae7d2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Overcoming challenges builds strength and pushes personal growth. It's about the journey and what we learn, not just winning. This was a great reminder for me. Got any examples from that sport you mentioned?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-5bc55f0165c9cdd3a96065a7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.852852+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5bc55f0165c9cdd3a96065a7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5bc55f0165c9cdd3a96065a7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, last year I had a basketball game where we were trailing big time in the 4th quarter. We had to dig deep and keep on pushing to overturn the deficit and it was amazing when that final buzzer sounded. Unforgettable feeling."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-e093d40db297a94a3937bd81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.869642+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e093d40db297a94a3937bd81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e093d40db297a94a3937bd81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow, that must have been an incredible feeling! You really showed determination and perseverance. Do you have any photos or keepsakes from the game? I'd love to see them! By the way, I have something special too - this is my prized possession, a basketball signed by my favorite player. It serves as a reminder of all the hard work."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-373516344d423e7503dc4dec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.885352+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "373516344d423e7503dc4dec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "373516344d423e7503dc4dec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow! What makes your favorite player so inspiring? Do you have any special stories or moments with them?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-a518d68e813ce0d2800ac27e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.909644+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a518d68e813ce0d2800ac27e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a518d68e813ce0d2800ac27e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I just love watching LeBron. There was this Finals game a few years back with an epic block that totally changed the game and ended up winning it. Seeing him go for it like that was such an inspiration - never give up, you know?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-98447751e10dfd07cf336b91", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.921554+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "98447751e10dfd07cf336b91", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "98447751e10dfd07cf336b91", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Remember that epic block in Game 7 of the '16 Finals? He chased down Iguodala and pinned the ball against the backboard. That kind of determination and heart is why I love basketball."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-217920a4b4a52c19a073ea00", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.938259+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "217920a4b4a52c19a073ea00", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "217920a4b4a52c19a073ea00", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Yeah, that's the one! It was awesome. Moments like that make me love sports and admire the players' determination and heart."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-856f82304ff138e0089449f8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.954961+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "856f82304ff138e0089449f8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "856f82304ff138e0089449f8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: LeBron's moments of determination and heart are incredible. It's why I enjoy playing and pushing myself. You never know when those special moments might occur, but it's always fun to be part of it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-baa2345ba47413bc50e54fe6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.969649+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "baa2345ba47413bc50e54fe6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "baa2345ba47413bc50e54fe6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Those special moments make it all worth it. It's amazing to be part of something bigger and feel the joy and fulfillment. Keep pushing and having those moments on the court!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-5002b9ddcda4f02db9a28eea", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:19.986527+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5002b9ddcda4f02db9a28eea", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5002b9ddcda4f02db9a28eea", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Speaking of special moments, my wife and I just left for our European vacation! It will be short but sweet. You've been before, any recommendations?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-383ee1a0f45959f1e1e89e04", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:20.000275+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "383ee1a0f45959f1e1e89e04", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "383ee1a0f45959f1e1e89e04", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: That's great! I hope you two have a great time. I would recommend visiting some castles, they are just so magical!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-940cb407c1493d1c7d546f46", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:20.015695+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "940cb407c1493d1c7d546f46", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "940cb407c1493d1c7d546f46", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! We'll have to check some out. Wishing you all the best with everything you're pursuing. Stay safe!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-6c03035a7c2a548304495877", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:20.031578+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6c03035a7c2a548304495877", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6c03035a7c2a548304495877", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! You too, buddy. Take it easy and keep going for it. Stay safe and let's stay in touch!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-locomo-conv-43/session_16-1ec9158be5d479ab8fbf06d6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:07:20.048408+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1ec9158be5d479ab8fbf06d6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1ec9158be5d479ab8fbf06d6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
